output:
Built this against Telegram's own navigation and action controls rather than in-page equivalents: back goes through the host `BackButton`, Pay is the host `MainButton` (not a sticky footer), colors come from `--tg-theme-*` CSS vars, layout sizes from `viewportStableHeight` + safe-area insets, and the form arms Telegram's closing-confirmation while dirty so a swipe-down can't silently discard input. A plain in-page "back to cart" control only renders as a fallback when the app isn't actually running inside Telegram (e.g. during local dev in a browser).

